<PageLayout title="How tuition works" lede="A simple process, so you know what to expect before the first session.">
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Free consultation.</strong> A 20-minute call to talk about goals, exam board and where the student feels stuck.</li>
    <li><strong>First session.</strong> We look at real classwork or past-paper questions, so the plan is based on evidence.</li>
    <li><strong>Regular sessions.</strong> Weekly or fortnightly, online, with a focus on understanding and worked problems.</li>
    <li><strong>Check-ins.</strong> Parents and carers can ask for a short summary of progress and next steps.</li>
  </ol>
  <h2>Online sessions</h2>
  <p>Sessions run over video call with a shared digital whiteboard. Students need a quiet space, a device with a camera and microphone, and their notes or textbook.</p>
